Subject: ntdll: emulate x86 execution breakpoints under Rosetta, with fast64
Date: 2026-10-11
Applies to: CrossOver 26.3.0 Wine sources (crossover-sources-26.3.0.tar.gz)
Files changed: dlls/ntdll/unix/signal_x86_64.c
Origin: ported by hand from wine-rosetta-fix (https://github.com/masonmcbride/wine-rosetta-fix,
LGPL-2.1); fast64 and WINE_ROSETTA_STATS added in this project.
Enabled by: WINE_ROSETTA_EXEC_BREAKPOINTS=1 (plus WINE_ROSETTA_WOW64_BREAKPOINTS=1,
WINE_ROSETTA_CALL_WORKAROUND=1 for 32-bit programs)
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, like the Wine file it modifies.
